==History==
2020 
*The Mother Witch was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Mother Witch Draft Challenge]], which started on 7/12/2020. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Mother Witch. If the player achieved at least 6 wins, they obtained the Mother Witch early.
2021
*The Mother Witch [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 4/1/2021.
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Mother Witch's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds), decreased her first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.5 seconds), and increased her damage by 14%. It also added the Mother Witch to all Draft selections.
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Mother Witch from Jungle Arena to Legendary Arena.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Mother Witch's hitpoints by 4%.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13). It also added two extra [[Star Points|Star Levels]].
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased the Mother Witch's hitpoints by 18%.
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue where the Mother Witch's [[Star Points|Star Levels]] used the sound effects of the [[Witch]].
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mother Witch's attack time interval to 1 second (from 1.1 seconds) and decreased her first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Mother Witch from Legendary Arena to Miner's Mine.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mother Witch's hitpoints by 0.2%.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Mother Witch's hitpoints by 0.18%.

