==Trivia==  
*The Mother Witch is based on [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Circe Circe], a Greek witch that appeared in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homer Homer]'s [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odyssey Odyssey] epic. In Odyssey, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus Odysseus] visits her island of Aeaea on the way back from the Trojan War and she changes most of his crew into swine. He managed to persuade her to return them to human shape, lived with her for a year and received advice on how to continue his journey back to Ithaca.
*The Mother Witch's stats are the highest or lowest among all [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]]. More specifically:
**The Cursed Hogs are tied with [[Hog Rider]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Princess]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], and the [[Terry]] for the longest sight range of all troops, with a sight range of 9.5 tiles.
**The Cursed Hogs has the shortest deployment time of all troops, with a deployment time of 0.2 seconds.
*The Cursed Hogs are 1 of 8 troops that can jump over the river, the others being Hog Rider, Royal Hogs, [[Dark Prince]], [[Prince]], [[Raging Prince]], [[Ram Rider]], and Santa Hog Rider.
*In the Russian and Chinese language setting of the game, the Mother Witch's name translates to "Grandmother Witch". In the Japanese language setting of the game, the Witch's name translates to "Mother Necromancer". In the Malaysian language setting of the game, the Mother Witch's name translates to "Magic Grandmother". In the French, Turkish, and Thai language setting of the game, the Mother Witch's names translates to "Granny Witch", "Old Witch", and "Great Grandmother" respectively.
*It is rumored that the [[Super Witch]] has been summoned from all the other 3 Witches, as demonstrated in the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VQf90EQVeX8 Super Witch trailer], hence explaining the combination of all the other Witches' abilities.
*When attacking, the Mother Witch may say "''Hocus Pocus''" or “''Oinkie Poinkie''”. She also laughs.
**The Mother Witch is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Mega Minion]], [[Wizard]], Hog Rider, [[P.E.K.K.A.]], Dark Prince, [[Bowler]], Ram Rider, [[Electro Wizard]], Princess, [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Lumberjack]], [[Fisherman]], [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], Santa Hog Rider, [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Little Prince]], and the Terry.
*The Mother Witch is 1 of 2 troops that have been featured with an [[Buff#Initial%20Spawn|Initial Spawn]] [[buff]], the other being the [[Skeleton King]].
*In the card's description, the “''She also bakes great cookies.''” line is likely a reference to [https://cookierun.fandom.com/wiki/Cookie_Run:_Kingdom Cookie Run: Kingdom] and [https://cookierun.fandom.com/wiki/Cookie_Run:_OvenBreak Cookie Run: OvenBreak]'','' as the characters are baked by a witch to be eaten.
*The Mother Witch and her Cursed Hogs are the subject of a few [[Emotes]].
**The Spooky Cursed Hog Emote is a reference to the [https://youtu.be/d-ABIIZV3vA?si=9VYzz0GeQHOmwrC8 Here's Johnny] scene from [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Shining_(film) The Shining].
*A [[Clone|cloned]] Mother Witch does not fall from the sky when deployed.
*The Mother Witch was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/vRrgTfqRdpw?si=YDASUydL7qNm9QZz Clash Royale League 2023 Tournament], by a player called Mugi.
*The initial balance change for Mother Witch on the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|7/6/2022 balance changes]] was an attack time interval decrease to 0.9 seconds (from 1.1 seconds), but it was raised to 1 second [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-36-balance-wip last minute].

